# Copy to `.env` and fill in. `.env` is gitignored — never commit a real key.
#
# IMPORTANT: this variable is deliberately NOT prefixed with VITE_.
# Vite inlines every VITE_* variable into the client bundle, so a key named
# VITE_MOONSHOT_API_KEY would be readable by anyone who opens devtools.
# This one is read only by the Vite dev server (see vite.config.ts), so it
# stays in the Node process.
#
# It is used ONLY by `npm run dev`. In production the app calls Launchpad's
# /__lp_llm_proxy, and the key lives in the host-server's environment instead.
MOONSHOT_API_KEY=

# Optional. Defaults to https://api.moonshot.ai/v1
# MOONSHOT_BASE_URL=

# Optional client-side settings. These ARE inlined into the bundle — they are
# not secret. Model id defaults to kimi-k3; confirm against Moonshot's model
# list, since providers publish dated suffixes.
# VITE_LLM_MODEL=kimi-k3
# VITE_LLM_PROVIDER=moonshot
